35
00:04:22,636 --> 00:04:32,836
[Slow] 美術館には、国宝10件を含む、およそ6300件の作品があります。

36
00:04:33,636 --> 00:04:38,891
[Host] The museum has about sixty-three hundred works, including ten National Treasures.

37
00:04:39,492 --> 00:04:41,627
[Vocab] 含む

38
00:04:42,028 --> 00:04:43,899
[Host] It means to include.

39
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:54,196
[Slow] 開館を記念して、これから半年の間に、3つの展覧会が開かれます。

40
00:04:54,995 --> 00:05:00,564
[Host] To mark the opening, three exhibitions will be held over the next six months.

41
00:05:01,163 --> 00:05:03,204
[Vocab] 記念

42
00:05:03,603 --> 00:05:05,524
[Host] It means commemoration.

43
00:05:06,124 --> 00:05:18,172
[Slow] その中で、江戸時代の画家、伊藤若冲の有名な絵30枚が、すべて並べて展示されます。

44
00:05:18,971 --> 00:05:25,500
[Host] Among them, all thirty famous paintings by an Edo-period painter will be shown side by side.

45
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:34,283
[Slow] 同じ日、美術館の近くに、新しい休憩所もできました。

46
00:05:35,084 --> 00:05:39,427
[Host] On the same day, a new rest house opened near the museum.

47
